<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88378" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόπους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one that has large feet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a star in the feet of the Twins</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span> Geminorum), <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				7.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>spur</i> of a mountain, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.17.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.13.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.5.8
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.501
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pers.
			</span></i>), etc.; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοίχων
				πρόποδες</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσπ-</span>cod.)
				<i>buttresses,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Tim.
				<u>Lex.</u>
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεῖσα.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>sheet</i> of a sail, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.566
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόποδα μέλεα</span>
			<i>moving forward</i> in procession, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				240
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
